Number of partitions of n into nonzero triangular numbers where every part appears at least 11 times.

The 100 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A161112

/-- Known terms of `A161112`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
